This project is a port of the DeepSeek Harness routing ecosystem to Claude Code.
The judgment logic and guidance texts in hook/ are line-for-line derived from:

- dsh-mode-boost/lib/core.js (MIT, yjh051108): classifyTask / isChatTask /
  isComplexTask / guideFor, the GUIDE_* texts and the WEAK_PRO / WEAK_FLASH
  personas. Copyright (c) 2026 yjh051108. MIT license terms apply.
- dsh-router-standard router-core.mjs (MIT, yjh051108): mode bands, personas,
